      "character": "clerk",
      "speaker": "Clerk",
      "text": "Every day you get turns. Each customer you meet costs one. Unused turns carry over to tomorrow, but only up to one day's worth, so sleeping in all week won't make you rich. Every funeral earns Bury Points. Whoever has the most at the end of the season wins, and gets to be smug at the Guild picnic.",
      "part": "whole",
